    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῠτᾰλ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stick</i>, <i><span class="en">
