				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλιον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>, esp. as used by fishermen for drawing the net to land,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
