				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				22.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				8.27
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.5
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαντος, κασσιτέρου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				443
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Bb</u>
				94
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				95
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>engine for hurling fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>finger-bone</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>
			v), <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.250
			</span></i>; of the neck, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοῦ
			αὐχένος</span> dub.in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				19.139
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>8.</b>
			
