				Polyaen.
				1.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>9.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>
			
