				1.7
			</span></i>, <i>handspike</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				86.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				4.3.11
			</span></i>: hence, <i>withy, willow wand</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Dim. of
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτάλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ -ίδων ἐβενίνων λείων
					ἐξομαλίζονται τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.1.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>small crab</i>, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρίς</span>
			kind, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>caterpillar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				720.45
			</span></i>.</div>
